{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/qt0balsb","slideIndex":6,"position":{"left":76,"top":190,"width":1128,"height":430},"text":"python3 -u tests/execution_lab.py\n\nThe driver starts PR A, PR B and release containers concurrently. Each writes its own credential to its private /work/private file and verifies the value. No host data is mounted.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":25.33,"typeface":"Courier","color":"#243447","alignment":"left"}}
