{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/kv6t8bq9","slideIndex":7,"position":{"left":76,"top":190,"width":1128,"height":430},"text":"The registry admits a newer A revision. The controller removes old A; B and release must still be running.\n\nDuplicate admission returns the same run. Stale A completion is rejected. A deliberate retry has a new event identity.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30.67,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#243447","alignment":"left"}}
