{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/l0ra54v6","slideIndex":9,"position":{"left":76,"top":190,"width":1128,"height":430},"text":"The driver runs a successful command and a failing assertion, preserving exit codes 0 and 1. A sleeping candidate exceeds its deadline and is removed.\n\nAn unavailable runtime gets three bounded attempts. Assertion failures get one attempt; they cannot retry until green.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30.67,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#243447","alignment":"left"}}
