{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/zq5kn2pg","slideIndex":10,"position":{"left":76,"top":190,"width":1128,"height":430},"text":"A separate Python controller starts a real container, then receives SIGKILL. Its orphan must exist before the independent reaper removes it.\n\nA different session survives. Foreign cleanup is refused. An unavailable cleanup transport raises an error; restored transport reclaims the resource.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30.67,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#243447","alignment":"left"}}
