{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/90fypo7e","slideIndex":13,"position":{"left":76,"top":190,"width":1128,"height":430},"text":"No hosted GitHub status, Oracle schema experiment or hostile-kernel isolation is claimed. The registry is in-memory; crash recovery reaps resources, not lost authoritative history.\n\nRetain the prototype and evidence. Production use requires a separate reviewed design. Do not activate another sprint.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30.67,"typeface":"Arial","color":"#243447","alignment":"left"}}
